RepayTest
├── given market is paused
│   └── it should revert
├── given both assets and shares are provided
│   └── it should revert
├── given onBehalf is zero address
│   └── it should revert
├── given assets is provided
│   ├── when assets is zero
│   │   └── it should revert
│   └── when assets is greater than zero
│       ├── when user has insufficient balance
│       │   └── it should revert
│       ├── when user has no borrow position
│       │   └── it should revert
│       └── when user has borrow position
│           ├── when repaying more than borrowed
│           │   └── it should revert
│           └── when repaying valid amount
│               └── it should repay and burn shares
└── given shares is provided
    ├── when shares is zero
    │   └── it should revert
    └── when shares is greater than zero
        ├── when user has insufficient balance
        │   └── it should revert
        ├── when user has no borrow position
        │   └── it should revert
        └── when user has borrow position
            ├── when repaying more than borrowed
            │   └── it should revert
            └── when repaying valid amount
                └── it should repay and burn shares 